---The object contains a risk score and a risk tier that evaluate the transaction return risk because an account is overdrawn or because an ineligible account is used. Common return codes in this category include: "R01", "R02", "R03", "R04", "R06", "R08", "R09", "R13", "R16", "R17", "R20", "R23". These returns have a turnaround time of 2 banking days.
---@class plaid.BankInitiatedReturnRisk
---@field score number
---@field risk_tier number

---Insights into bank penalties and fees, including overdraft fees, NSF fees, and other bank-imposed charges.
---@class plaid.BankPenaltiesIndicators
---@field amount? number|distilled.Null The total value of outflow transactions categorized as `BANK_PENALTIES`, across all the accounts in the report within the requested time window.
---@field iso_currency_code? string|distilled.Null The ISO-4217 currency code of the amount. Always `null` if `unofficial_currency_code` is non-`null`.
---@field unofficial_currency_code? string|distilled.Null The unofficial currency code associated with the amount. Always `null` if `iso_currency_code` is non-`null`. See the [currency code schema](https://plaid.com/docs/api/accounts#currency-code-schema) for a full listing of supported `unofficial_currency_code`s.
---@field monthly_average? plaid.MonthlyAverage|distilled.Null
---@field category_details? plaid.BankPenaltiesIndicatorsCategoryDetailsList Detailed categories view of all the transactions that fall into the `BANK_PENALTIES` credit category within the given time window, across all the accounts in the report.
---@field transactions_count? number|distilled.Null The total number of transactions that fall into the `BANK_PENALTIES` credit category, across all the accounts in the report.
---@field monthly_summaries? plaid.BankPenaltiesIndicatorsMonthlySummariesList The monthly summaries of the transactions that fall into the `BANK_PENALTIES` credit category within the given time window, across all the accounts in the report.
---@field days_since_last_occurrence? number|distilled.Null The number of days since the last transaction that falls into the `BANK_PENALTIES` credit category, across all the accounts in the report.
---@field percentage_of_income? number|distilled.Null The percentage of the user's monthly inflows that was spent on transactions that fall into the `BANK_PENALTIES` credit category within the given time window, across all the accounts in the report. For example, a value of 100 represents that 100% of the inflows were spent on transactions that fall into the `BANK_PENALTIES` credit category. If there's no available income for the given time period, this field value will be `-1`.
---@field [string] any

---Detailed categories view of all the transactions that fall into the `BANK_PENALTIES` credit category within the given time window, across all the accounts in the report.
---@alias plaid.BankPenaltiesIndicatorsCategoryDetailsList (plaid.CategoryExpenses|distilled.Null)[]

---The monthly summaries of the transactions that fall into the `BANK_PENALTIES` credit category within the given time window, across all the accounts in the report.
---@alias plaid.BankPenaltiesIndicatorsMonthlySummariesList (plaid.MonthlySummary|distilled.Null)[]

