---@field ach_return_code? string|distilled.Null The ACH return code, e.g. `R01`. A return code will be provided if and only if the transfer status is `reversed`. For a full listing of ACH return codes, see [Bank Transfers errors](https://plaid.com/docs/errors/bank-transfers/#ach-return-codes).
---@field description? string|distilled.Null A human-readable description of the reason for the failure or reversal.
