---@alias plaid.BaseReportAccountHistoricalBalancesList plaid.BaseReportHistoricalBalance[]

---Calculated insights derived from transaction-level data. This field has been deprecated in favor of [Base Report attributes aggregated across accounts](https://plaid.com/docs/api/products/check-legacy/#cra-check_report-base_report-get-response-report-attributes) and will be removed in a future release.
---@class plaid.BaseReportAccountInsights
---@field oldest_transaction_date? string|distilled.Null Date of the earliest transaction for the account.
---@field most_recent_transaction_date? string|distilled.Null Date of the most recent transaction for the account.
---@field days_available? number Number of days available for the account.
---@field average_days_between_transactions? number Average number of days between sequential transactions
---@field longest_gaps_between_transactions? plaid.BaseReportAccountInsightsLongestGapsBetweenTransactionsList Longest gap between sequential transactions in a time period. This array can include multiple time periods.
---@field number_of_inflows? plaid.BaseReportAccountInsightsNumberOfInflowsList The number of transactions that moved money into the account. This array will be empty for non-depository accounts.
---@field average_inflow_amounts? plaid.BaseReportAccountInsightsAverageInflowAmountsList Average amount of transactions that moved money into the account in a time period. This array will be empty for non-depository accounts. This field only takes into account USD transactions from the account.
---@field number_of_outflows? plaid.BaseReportAccountInsightsNumberOfOutflowsList The number of outflows from the account. This array will be empty for non-depository accounts.
---@field average_outflow_amounts? plaid.BaseReportAccountInsightsAverageOutflowAmountsList Average amount of transactions out of the account in a time period. This array will be empty for non-depository accounts. This field only takes into account USD transactions from the account.
---@field number_of_days_no_transactions? number Number of days with no transactions
---@field [string] any

---Average amount of transactions that moved money into the account in a time period. This array will be empty for non-depository accounts. This field only takes into account USD transactions from the account.
---@alias plaid.BaseReportAccountInsightsAverageInflowAmountsList plaid.BaseReportAverageFlowInsights[]

---Average amount of transactions out of the account in a time period. This array will be empty for non-depository accounts. This field only takes into account USD transactions from the account.
---@alias plaid.BaseReportAccountInsightsAverageOutflowAmountsList plaid.BaseReportAverageFlowInsights[]

---Longest gap between sequential transactions in a time period. This array can include multiple time periods.
---@alias plaid.BaseReportAccountInsightsLongestGapsBetweenTransactionsList plaid.BaseReportLongestGapInsights[]

---The number of transactions that moved money into the account. This array will be empty for non-depository accounts.
---@alias plaid.BaseReportAccountInsightsNumberOfInflowsList plaid.BaseReportNumberFlowInsights[]

---The number of outflows from the account. This array will be empty for non-depository accounts.
---@alias plaid.BaseReportAccountInsightsNumberOfOutflowsList plaid.BaseReportNumberFlowInsights[]

