---This is a V1 (II1) schema. For the V2 (II2) equivalent, use `CraIncomeInsightsUserSummary`. Summary for income across all income sources and items (max history of 730 days).
---@class plaid.CraBankIncomeSummary
---@field total_amounts? plaid.CraBankIncomeSummaryTotalAmountsList Total amount of earnings across all the income sources in the end user's Items for the days requested by the client. This can contain multiple amounts, with each amount denominated in one unique currency.
---@field start_date? string The earliest date within the days requested in which all income sources identified by Plaid appear in a user's account. The date will be returned in an ISO 8601 format (YYYY-MM-DD).
---@field end_date? string The latest date in which all income sources identified by Plaid appear in the user's account. The date will be returned in an ISO 8601 format (YYYY-MM-DD).
---@field income_sources_count? number Number of income sources per end user.
---@field income_categories_count? number Number of income categories per end user.
---@field income_transactions_count? number Number of income transactions per end user.
---@field historical_average_monthly_gross_income? plaid.CraBankIncomeSummaryHistoricalAverageMonthlyGrossIncomeList An estimate of the average gross monthly income based on the historical net amount and income category for the income source(s). The average monthly income is calculated based on the lifetime of the income stream, rather than the entire historical period included in the scope of the report.
---@field historical_average_monthly_income? plaid.CraBankIncomeSummaryHistoricalAverageMonthlyIncomeList The average monthly income amount estimated based on the historical data for the income source(s). The average monthly income is calculated based on the lifetime of the income stream, rather than the entire historical period included in the scope of the report.
---@field forecasted_average_monthly_income? plaid.CraBankIncomeSummaryForecastedAverageMonthlyIncomeList The predicted average monthly income amount for the income source(s).
---@field historical_annual_gross_income? plaid.CraBankIncomeSummaryHistoricalAnnualGrossIncomeList An estimate of the annual gross income for the income source, calculated by multiplying the `historical_average_monthly_gross_income` by 12.
---@field historical_annual_income? plaid.CraBankIncomeSummaryHistoricalAnnualIncomeList An estimate of the annual net income for the income source, calculated by multiplying the `historical_average_monthly_income` by 12.
---@field forecasted_annual_income? plaid.CraBankIncomeSummaryForecastedAnnualIncomeList The predicted average annual income amount for the income source(s).
---@field historical_summary? plaid.CraBankIncomeSummaryHistoricalSummaryList
---@field [string] any

