---@field exclude_transactions? boolean|distilled.Null When set to `true`, this option excludes account transaction records from the Base Report before it is stored. In the `/cra/check_report/base_report/get` response, each account's `transactions` field remains present as an empty array. This option does not affect insight calculations. Omitting this option or setting it to `null` or `false` preserves existing behavior. These values do not override any client configuration that excludes transactions. Requests with `exclude_transactions` set to `true` are rejected with an `INVALID_FIELD` error if they also request GSE or Home Lending reports. A Base Report created with this option set to `true` cannot be used to generate those reports later.

