---@field status plaid.CraLoanStatus|string
---@field date string
---@field [string] any

---Contains the payment information for a loan payment period.
---@class plaid.CraLoanPaymentHistory
---@field period number The index to identify the loan's payment period, starting from 1. For example: 1 means the period between the loan's opening date and the 1st payment due date. 2 means the period between the loan's 1st payment due date and 2nd payment due date.
---@field due_date string The payment due date or end date of the payment period. The date should be in ISO 8601 format (YYYY-MM-DD).
---@field days_past_due number The number of days the loan was delinquent at the end of the pay period. If specified, should be greater than or equal to 0.
---@field amount_past_due? number The amount past due or the charge-off amount of the loan at the end of the payment period.
---@field balance_remaining? number The balance remaining on the loan at the end of the payment period.
---@field [string] any

---The frequency of a loan's payment schedule.
---`BIWEEKLY` represents one payment every two weeks.
---@alias plaid.CraLoanPaymentSchedule "DAILY"|"WEEKLY"|"BIWEEKLY"|"MONTHLY"|"QUARTERLY"|"ANNUALLY"|"OTHER"

