---Report characteristics returned by FICO describing the banking data used to generate the UltraFICO® score.
---@class plaid.CraPartnerInsightsFicoReportCharacteristics
---@field num_accounts? number|distilled.Null Total number of accounts included in the report. Limited to checking, savings, and money market accounts.
---@field avg_daily_balance_over_1_month? number|distilled.Null Average daily balance over the past 1 month.
---@field avg_daily_balance_over_3_months? number|distilled.Null Average daily balance over the past 3 months.
---@field avg_daily_balance_over_6_months? number|distilled.Null Average daily balance over the past 6 months.
---@field avg_daily_balance_over_12_months? number|distilled.Null Average daily balance over the past 12 months.
---@field days_since_earliest_tx? number|distilled.Null Number of days since the earliest transaction in the report.
---@field days_since_most_recent_negative_ending_balance? number|distilled.Null Number of days since the most recent day with a negative ending balance.
---@field days_since_most_recent_insufficient_funds_fee_debit_tx? number|distilled.Null Number of days since the most recent insufficient funds fee debit transaction.
---@field tot_number_days_with_negative_balance_over_1_month? number|distilled.Null Total number of days with a negative balance over the past 1 month.
---@field tot_number_days_with_negative_balance_over_3_months? number|distilled.Null Total number of days with a negative balance over the past 3 months.
---@field tot_number_days_with_negative_balance_over_6_months? number|distilled.Null Total number of days with a negative balance over the past 6 months.
---@field tot_number_days_with_negative_balance_over_12_months? number|distilled.Null Total number of days with a negative balance over the past 12 months.
---@field days_since_most_recent_tx? number|distilled.Null Number of days since the most recent transaction.
---@field days_with_tx_over_1_month? number|distilled.Null Number of days with at least one transaction over the past 1 month.
---@field days_with_tx_over_3_months? number|distilled.Null Number of days with at least one transaction over the past 3 months.
---@field days_with_tx_over_6_months? number|distilled.Null Number of days with at least one transaction over the past 6 months.
---@field days_with_tx_over_12_months? number|distilled.Null Number of days with at least one transaction over the past 12 months.
---@field tot_current_balances? number|distilled.Null Sum of current balances across all accounts in the report.
---@field num_checking_accounts? number|distilled.Null Number of checking accounts included in the report.
---@field num_money_market_accounts? number|distilled.Null Number of money market accounts included in the report.
---@field num_savings_accounts? number|distilled.Null Number of savings accounts included in the report.

