---The balances of an account in a Base Report.
---@class plaid.CraReportGetBaseReportAccountBalances
---@field available number|distilled.Null The amount of funds available to be withdrawn from the account, as determined by the financial institution. For `credit`-type accounts, the `available` balance typically equals the `limit` less the `current` balance, less any pending outflows plus any pending inflows. For `depository`-type accounts, the `available` balance typically equals the `current` balance less any pending outflows plus any pending inflows, and does not include the overdraft limit. For `investment`-type accounts, the `available` balance is the total cash available to withdraw as presented by the institution. `null` if the institution does not provide an `available` balance. If `current` is `null`, this field is guaranteed not to be `null`.
---@field current number|distilled.Null The total amount of funds in or owed by the account. For `credit`-type accounts, a positive balance indicates the amount owed; a negative amount indicates the lender owing the account holder. For `loan`-type accounts, the current balance is the principal remaining on the loan. For `investment`-type accounts, the current balance is the total value of assets as presented by the institution. If `available` is `null`, this field is guaranteed not to be `null`.
---@field limit number|distilled.Null For `credit`-type accounts, the credit limit. For `depository`-type accounts, the pre-arranged overdraft limit. This field is typically only available for `credit`-type accounts.
---@field iso_currency_code string|distilled.Null
---@field unofficial_currency_code string|distilled.Null
---@field average_balance number|distilled.Null The average historical balance over the time range of the report. `null` if it could not be computed.
---@field most_recent_thirty_day_average_balance number|distilled.Null The average historical balance over the most recent 30 days. `null` if it could not be computed.
---@field average_monthly_balances plaid.CraReportGetBaseReportAccountBalancesAverageMonthlyBalancesList The average historical balance for each calendar month. Empty if it could not be computed.
---@field [string] any

