---A transaction in a Base Report returned by `/cra/report/get`.
---@class plaid.CraReportGetBaseReportTransaction
---@field transaction_id string The unique ID of the transaction. Like all Plaid identifiers, the `transaction_id` is case sensitive.
---@field account_id string The ID of the account in which this transaction occurred.
---@field amount number The settled value of the transaction, denominated in the transaction's currency, as stated in `iso_currency_code` or `unofficial_currency_code`. Positive values when money moves out of the account; negative values when money moves in. For example, debit card purchases are positive; credit card payments, direct deposits, and refunds are negative.
---@field iso_currency_code string|distilled.Null
---@field unofficial_currency_code string|distilled.Null
---@field original_description string|distilled.Null The string returned by the financial institution to describe the transaction.
---@field merchant_name string|distilled.Null The merchant name, as enriched by Plaid. `null` for transactions with no meaningful merchant, such as checks or account transfers.
---@field credit_category plaid.CreditCategory|distilled.Null
---@field check_number string|distilled.Null The check number of the transaction. Only populated for check transactions.
---@field date string For pending transactions, the date that the transaction occurred; for posted transactions, the date that the transaction posted. Returned in [ISO 8601](https://wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601) format (YYYY-MM-DD).
---@field date_transacted string|distilled.Null The date on which the transaction took place, in [ISO 8601](https://wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601) format (YYYY-MM-DD). `null` if the financial institution did not provide it.
---@field pending boolean When `true`, identifies the transaction as pending or unsettled. Pending transaction details (`amount`, `merchant_name`, `credit_category`) may change before they are settled.
---@field account_owner string|distilled.Null The name of the account owner. This field is not typically populated and only relevant when dealing with sub-accounts.
---@field location plaid.Location
---@field name? string|distilled.Null The merchant name or transaction description. Note: This is a legacy field that is not actively maintained. Use `merchant_name` instead for the merchant name.
---@field category? plaid.CraReportGetBaseReportTransactionCategoryList A hierarchical array of the categories to which this transaction belongs. For a full list of categories, see [`/categories/get`](https://plaid.com/docs/api/products/transactions/#categoriesget).
---@field category_id? string|distilled.Null The ID of the category to which this transaction belongs. For a full list of categories, see [`/categories/get`](https://plaid.com/docs/api/products/transactions/#categoriesget).
---@field personal_finance_category? plaid.PersonalFinanceCategory|distilled.Null
---@field [string] any

