---An individual LendScore variant result returned by `/cra/report/get`.
---@class plaid.CraReportGetLendScoreVariantScore
---@field variant plaid.CraLendScoreVariant
---@field score number|distilled.Null The score returned by the LendScore model for this variant.
---@field reason_codes plaid.CraReportGetLendScoreVariantScoreReasonCodesList The reasons for an individual having risk according to this LendScore variant. For a full list of possible reason codes and a mapping of reason codes to human-readable reasons, contact your Plaid account manager. Empty if the variant could not be computed.
---@field error_code string|distilled.Null The error code explaining why this LendScore variant could not be computed. `null` on success. Possible values: `INSUFFICIENT_TRANSACTION_HISTORY_30D`: User must have at least 30 days of transaction history `INSUFFICIENT_TRANSACTIONS_30D`: User must have at least 1 transaction in the past 30 days `INSUFFICIENT_INFLOW_TRANSACTIONS_30D`: User must have at least 1 inflow transaction in the past 30 days `INSUFFICIENT_INFLOW_TRANSACTIONS_180D`: User must have at least 2 inflow transactions in the past 180 days `INSUFFICIENT_OUTFLOW_TRANSACTIONS_30D`: User must have at least 2 outflow transactions in the past 30 days `INSUFFICIENT_OUTFLOW_TRANSACTIONS_180D`: User must have at least 4 outflow transactions in the past 180 days `BALANCE_UNAVAILABLE`: Balance unavailable for one or more of the user's accounts Other failures return `PRODUCT_GENERATION_FAILED`. New codes may be added over time, so treat an unrecognized value as a generic failure.
---@field [string] any

---The reasons for an individual having risk according to this LendScore variant. For a full list of possible reason codes and a mapping of reason codes to human-readable reasons, contact your Plaid account manager. Empty if the variant could not be computed.
---@alias plaid.CraReportGetLendScoreVariantScoreReasonCodesList string[]

