---@class plaid.CreatePaymentInitiationConsentRequest
---@field client_id? string
---@field secret? string|distilled.Secret
---@field recipient_id string The ID of the recipient the payment consent is for. The created consent can be used to transfer funds to this recipient only.
---@field user_id? string The `user_id` of the end user the payment consent is for, as returned by [`/user/create`](https://plaid.com/docs/api/users/#usercreate). The user must have a `name` and either an email address or a phone number. Payments created from this consent inherit this `user_id`. Required for new integrations.
---@field reference string A reference for the payment consent. This must be a string of at most 18 characters containing only letters, numbers, and spaces.
