---The details of a bank employment verification in Link.
---@class plaid.CreditSessionBankEmploymentResult
---@field status? plaid.CreditSessionBankEmploymentStatus
---@field item_id? string The Plaid Item ID. The `item_id` is always unique; linking the same account at the same institution twice will result in two Items with different `item_id` values. Like all Plaid identifiers, the `item_id` is case-sensitive.
---@field institution_id? string The Plaid Institution ID associated with the Item.

---Status of the Bank Employment Link session.
---
---`APPROVED`: User has approved and verified their employment.
---
---`NO_EMPLOYERS_FOUND`: We attempted, but were unable to find any employment in the connected account.
---
---`EMPLOYER_NOT_LISTED`: The user explicitly indicated that they did not see their current or previous employer in the list of employer names found.
---
---`STARTED`: The user began the bank employment portion of the link flow.
---
---`INTERNAL_ERROR`: The user encountered an internal error.
---@alias plaid.CreditSessionBankEmploymentStatus "APPROVED"|"NO_EMPLOYERS_FOUND"|"EMPLOYER_NOT_LISTED"|"STARTED"|"INTERNAL_ERROR"

---The details of a bank income verification in Link
---@class plaid.CreditSessionBankIncomeResult
---@field status? plaid.CreditSessionBankIncomeStatus
---@field item_id? string The Plaid Item ID. The `item_id` is always unique; linking the same account at the same institution twice will result in two Items with different `item_id` values. Like all Plaid identifiers, the `item_id` is case-sensitive.
---@field institution_id? string The Plaid Institution ID associated with the Item.

---Status of the Bank Income Link session.
---
---`APPROVED`: User has approved and verified their income
---
---`NO_DEPOSITS_FOUND`: We attempted, but were unable to find any income in the connected account.
---
---`USER_REPORTED_NO_INCOME`: The user explicitly indicated that they don't receive income in the connected account.
---
---`STARTED`: The user began the bank income portion of the link flow.
---
---`INTERNAL_ERROR`: The user encountered an internal error.
---@alias plaid.CreditSessionBankIncomeStatus "APPROVED"|"NO_DEPOSITS_FOUND"|"USER_REPORTED_NO_INCOME"|"STARTED"|"INTERNAL_ERROR"

---The details of a document income verification in Link
---@class plaid.CreditSessionDocumentIncomeResult
