---@field counterparty plaid.WalletTransactionCounterparty
---@field amount plaid.WalletTransactionAmount
---@field user_id? string The `user_id` of the end user the transaction is for, as returned by [`/user/create`](https://plaid.com/docs/api/users/#usercreate). The user must have a `name` and either an email address or a phone number. Required for new integrations.
---@field reference string A reference for the transaction. This must be a string of 6 to 18 characters containing only letters, numbers, and spaces. Ensure that the `reference` field is unique for each transaction.
