---@field selfie_check boolean A boolean field specifying whether the new session should require or skip the `selfie_check` step. If a previous session has already passed the `selfie_check` step, the new selfie check will be a Selfie Reauthentication check, in which the selfie is tested for liveness and for consistency with the previous selfie.

