---@field dimensions_check plaid.ImageQualityOutcome The outcome of the dimensions check. `success` - The image meets the minimum size and resolution requirements. `failed` - The image does not meet the minimum size or resolution requirements.
---@field blur_check plaid.ImageQualityOutcome The outcome of the blur check. `success` - The image is sufficiently sharp. `failed` - The image is too blurry for analysis.
