---Metadata about an event that occurred while the user was going through Link
---@class plaid.LinkEventMetadata
---@field error_code? string The error code that the user encountered. Emitted by `ERROR`, `EXIT`.
---@field error_message? string The error message that the user encountered. Emitted by: `ERROR`, `EXIT`.
---@field error_type? string The error type that the user encountered. Emitted by: `ERROR`, `EXIT`.
---@field exit_status? string The status key indicates the point at which the user exited the Link flow. Emitted by: `EXIT`.
---@field institution_id? string The ID of the selected institution. Emitted by: all events.
---@field institution_name? string The name of the selected institution. Emitted by: all events.
---@field institution_search_query? string The query used to search for institutions. Emitted by: `SEARCH_INSTITUTION`.
---@field request_id? string The request ID for the last request made by Link. This can be shared with Plaid support to expedite investigation. Emitted by: all events.
---@field mfa_type? string If set, the user has encountered one of the following MFA types: code, device, questions, selections. Emitted by: `SUBMIT_MFA` and `TRANSITION_VIEW` when `view_name` is `MFA`.
---@field view_name? string The name of the view that is being transitioned to. Emitted by: `TRANSITION_VIEW`.
---@field selection? string Either the verification method for a matched institution selected by the user or the Auth Type Select flow type selected by the user. If selection is used to describe selected verification method, then possible values are `phoneotp` or `password`; if selection is used to describe the selected Auth Type Select flow, then possible values are `flow_type_manual` or `flow_type_instant`. Emitted by: `MATCHED_SELECT_VERIFY_METHOD` and `SELECT_AUTH_TYPE`.
---@field brand_name? string The name of the selected brand.
---@field match_reason? string The reason this institution was matched. This will be either `returning_user` or `routing_number` if emitted by `MATCHED_SELECT_INSTITUTION`. Otherwise, this will be `SAVED_INSTITUTION` or `AUTO_SELECT_SAVED_INSTITUTION` if emitted by `SELECT_INSTITUTION`.
---@field routing_number? string The routing number submitted by the user at the micro-deposits routing number pane. Emitted by `SUBMIT_ROUTING_NUMBER`.
---@field account_number_mask? string The account number mask extracted from the user-provided account number. If the user-inputted account number is four digits long, `account_number_mask` is empty. Emitted by `SUBMIT_ACCOUNT_NUMBER`.
