---@field detailed string A granular category conveying the transaction's intent. This field can also be used as a unique identifier for the category.
---@field confidence_level? string|distilled.Null A description of how confident we are that the provided categories accurately describe the transaction intent. `VERY_HIGH`: We are more than 98% confident that this category reflects the intent of the transaction. `HIGH`: We are more than 90% confident that this category reflects the intent of the transaction. `MEDIUM`: We are moderately confident that this category reflects the intent of the transaction. `LOW`: This category may reflect the intent, but there may be other categories that are more accurate. `UNKNOWN`: We don't know the confidence level for this category.
---@field version? plaid.PersonalFinanceCategoryVersion
---@field [string] any

