---@field cash_advance_bucket_200_300? number|distilled.Null Subscore for cash advance amounts in the range $200-$300.
---@field cash_advance_bucket_300_400? number|distilled.Null Subscore for cash advance amounts in the range $300-$400.
---@field cash_advance_bucket_400_500? number|distilled.Null Subscore for cash advance amounts in the range $400-$500.
