---A Protect report associated with a user. Contains details about documented incidents, which may include fraud, investigation outcomes, or other risk events.
---@class plaid.ProtectReport
---@field report_id string A unique identifier representing the submitted report.
---@field incident_event plaid.ProtectIncidentEventResponse|distilled.Null
