---@field optimal_date string|distilled.Null The recommended optimal date to submit the debit entry, formatted in ISO 8601 "YYYY-MM-DD" (e.g., "2024-03-30"). The `optimal_date` is derived from the date with rank = 1 in the following recommendations array. NOTE: The `default_payment_method` field specified in the request will affect the recommendation, since we're accounting for debit settlement time. The debit scheduling evaluation covers the banking days within the seven calendar days after the /signal/schedule request is submitted; the day of the request is never recommended. If no date within this period is considered likely to result in a successful debit attempt, `null` will be returned for the `optimal_date`.
---@field recommendations plaid.SignalScheduleResponseRecommendationsList This array provides a date-by-date evaluation of debit submission recommendations within the evaluation period. Each object in the array represents a retry recommendation for a specific date.
