---@field next_payment_due_date string|distilled.Null The due date for the next payment. The due date is `null` if a payment is not expected. A payment is not expected if `loan_status.type` is `deferment`, `in school`, `consolidated`, `paid in full`, or `transferred`. Dates are returned in an [ISO 8601](https://wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601) format (YYYY-MM-DD).
