---@field origination_principal_amount number|distilled.Null The original principal balance of the loan.
---@field outstanding_interest_amount number|distilled.Null The total dollar amount of the accrued interest balance. For Sallie Mae ( `ins_116944`), this amount is included in the current balance of the loan, so this field will return as `null`.
---@field payment_reference_number string|distilled.Null The relevant account number that should be used to reference this loan for payments. In the majority of cases, `payment_reference_number` will match `account_number`, but in some institutions, such as Great Lakes (`ins_116861`), it will be different.
