---@field unauthorized_return_window string|distilled.Null The date 61 business days from settlement date indicating the following ACH returns can no longer happen: R05, R07, R10, R11, R51, R33, R37, R38, R52, R53. This will be of the form YYYY-MM-DD.
---@field expected_settlement_date string|distilled.Null Deprecated for Plaid Ledger clients, use `expected_funds_available_date` instead.
---@field expected_funds_available_date? string|distilled.Null The expected date when funds from a transfer will be made available and can be withdrawn from the associated ledger balance, assuming the debit does not return before this date. If the transfer does return before this date, this field will be null. Only applies to debit transfers. This will be of the form YYYY-MM-DD.
---@field originator_client_id string|distilled.Null The Plaid client ID that is the originator of this transfer. Only present if created on behalf of another client as a [Platform customer](https://plaid.com/docs/transfer/application/#originators-vs-platforms).
