---@field recurring_transfer_id string|distilled.Null The id of the recurring transfer if this transfer belongs to a recurring transfer.
---@field expected_sweep_settlement_schedule? plaid.TransferExpectedSweepSettlementScheduleList The expected sweep settlement schedule of this transfer, assuming this transfer is not `returned`. Only applies to ACH debit transfers.
