---Represents an event in the Transfers API.
---@class plaid.TransferEvent
---@field event_id number Plaid's unique identifier for this event. IDs are sequential unsigned 64-bit integers.
---@field timestamp string The datetime when this event occurred. This will be of the form `2006-01-02T15:04:05Z`.
---@field event_type plaid.TransferEventType
---@field account_id? string The account ID associated with the transfer. This field is omitted for Plaid Ledger Sweep events.
---@field funding_account_id string|distilled.Null
---@field ledger_id? string|distilled.Null
---@field transfer_id string Plaid's unique identifier for a transfer. This field is an empty string for Plaid Ledger Sweep events.
---@field origination_account_id string|distilled.Null The ID of the origination account that this balance belongs to.
---@field transfer_type? plaid.OmittableTransferType
---@field transfer_amount? string The amount of the transfer (decimal string with two digits of precision e.g. "10.00"). For refund events and `funds_available` events, this is the amount associated with the event, such as the refund amount, rather than the original transfer amount. This field is omitted for Plaid Ledger Sweep events.
---@field failure_reason plaid.TransferFailure|distilled.Null
---@field sweep_id string|distilled.Null
---@field sweep_amount string|distilled.Null
---@field event_amount? string|distilled.Null A signed amount associated with this event (decimal string with two digits of precision e.g. "10.00" or "-10.00").
---@field refund_id string|distilled.Null Plaid's unique identifier for a refund. A non-null value indicates the event is for the associated refund of the transfer.
---@field originator_client_id string|distilled.Null The Plaid client ID that is the originator of the transfer that this event applies to. Only present if the transfer was created on behalf of another client as a third-party sender (TPS).
---@field intent_id? string|distilled.Null The `id` returned by the `/transfer/intent/create` endpoint, for transfers created via Transfer UI. For transfers not created by Transfer UI, this field is omitted. This will currently only be populated for RfP transfers.
---@field wire_return_fee? string|distilled.Null The fee amount deducted from the original transfer during a wire return, if applicable.
