---@field ach_return_code? string|distilled.Null The ACH return code, e.g. `R01`. A return code will be provided if the transfer status is `returned`, and may also be provided if the transfer status is `failed`. For a full listing of ACH return codes, see [Transfer errors](https://plaid.com/docs/errors/transfer/#ach-return-codes).
---@field description? string A human-readable description of the reason for the failure, reversal, or adjustment.
---@field [string] any

